# The code name of each minor version of XeeonOS, for people: shown in
# `xctl status`, in the boot menu (os-release VERSION_CODENAME, PRETTY_NAME),
# and usable as a channel name: `xctl channel <name>` means <version>-stable.
# Branches, channels and versions stay numeric (docs/updates.md).
#
# <major.minor> <name>     (lowercase letters only), e.g.:
# 1.0 maverick
# 1.1 dodo
